pported her tireless pursuit of scientific discovery. As she settled into her chair, Suping's gaze fell upon a stack of papers, marked with the Instituto Gulbenkian de Ciência's logo – a stylized representation of a DNA double helix, symbolizing the institute's commitment to advancing the frontiers of biological and biomedical research.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["University of Nebraska–Lincoln", "Instituto Gulbenkian de Ciência"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "University of Nebraska–Lincoln", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Instituto Gulbenkian de Ciência", "origin": "initial"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}
